{"sectionId":"circulation/vessels","items":[{"id":"circulation--vessels-k001","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"혈류 Q=ΔP/R이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k002","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"이상적 층류 원통에서 R=8ηL/(πr⁴)이므로 반지름 변화에 민감하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k003","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"소동맥은 저항 조절, 정맥은 용량 저장, 모세혈관은 교환에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k004","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"평균동맥압은 정상 심박수에서 이완기압+맥압/3으로 근사할 수 있으며 MAP−중심정맥압=CO×전신혈관저항이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k005","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"압수용기는 경동맥동과 대동맥궁의 신장 변화를 감지하여 자율신경 출력을 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k006","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"모세혈관 수분 이동은 정수압, 단백질에 의한 교질삼투압, 투과성 및 glycocalyx 등으로 결정된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k007","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"고전 Starling 식 Jv=Kf[(Pc−Pi)−σ(πc−πi)]은 개념적 근사이며 정상 조직에서 지속적인 정맥말단 재흡수를 보편적으로 가정하면 안 된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k008","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"림프계는 여과된 체액과 단백질을 순환으로 돌려보낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k009","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"부종은 모세혈관 압력 증가, 혈장 단백질 감소, 투과성 증가, 림프 배출 장애 등으로 발생할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k010","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"저항은 반지름의 네제곱에 반비례하는 이상적 모델을 따른다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k011","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"동맥·정맥은 산소량이 아니라 심장에 대한 흐름 방향으로 정의한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k012","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"압수용기 신장 증가→교감 감소·부교감 증가 경향.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"circulation--vessels-k013","sectionId":"circulation/vessels","unitId":"circulation","subject":"biology","text":"16배가 된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}